Update a destination

Usage: vendo destinations update [OPTIONS] <destinationId>

Arguments:
  <destinationId>  

Options:
      --config-file <path>    Replace config from a JSON file
      --profile <name>        Use a specific account profile
      --debug                 Enable verbose request diagnostics
      --schedule-file <path>  Replace schedule from a JSON file
      --frequency <value>     Sync frequency value
      --unit <unit>           Sync frequency unit
      --json                  Output raw JSON
      --output <field>        Print a single field (e.g. id)
  -h, --help                  Print help

Examples:
  $ vendo destinations update <destinationId> --frequency 6 --unit hours
  $ vendo destinations update <destinationId> --config-file new-tasks.json
